!.env.local.example

# Plaintext credential notes. This repo is public, so a stray key file in the
# tree is one `git add .` away from being published. Secrets belong in
# .env.local for local dev and in `wrangler secret put` for the deployed Worker.
*[Aa][Pp][Ii]*[Kk][Ee][Yy]*.txt
*[Ss][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]*.txt
*[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ii][Aa][Ll]*.txt
*.pem
*.p12
service-account*.json

